michi naki michi wo yuku no

20
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:08,380
soko ni itatte matteitatte

21
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:11,270
nani mo hajimaranai

22
00:01:11,270 --> 00:01:12,010
chAngE

23
00:01:12,010 --> 00:01:14,180
nabikanai nagasarenai yo

24
